{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806960/extras/gameLogo.png?t=1750199039\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806960/extras/rat_run.gif?t=1750199039\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806960/extras/experience_rat.png?t=1750199039\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience Rat Like Never Before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In<i> Really Fast Rat,</i> you take control of a little Rat who, after losing their cheese to a spatial anomaly, must run through a new world. A world with new people, new places, and new rules. But who cares about that when you're a Rat looking for cheese am I right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you be able to help our brave and noble Rat make their way out of this strange new world? Probably not, since that's not the goal of the game, the goal is to find the cheese, keep up please!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806960/extras/features.png?t=1750199039\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full Singleplayer campaign with several levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tailored moveset.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Levels with several paths to take.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A unique take on video game dashes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pace indicators and PB saving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ranks to beat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hub worlds to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlockable hats to customise the Rat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cute player sprites and animations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And More!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3806960?t=1750199039","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806960/13cec098044fb17a1c22fab06774dc31240bcb24/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750199039","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806960/c74115613906a946ac1c211eebfbf416332957f3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750199039","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806960/c74115613906a946ac1c211eebfbf416332957f3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750199039","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806960/extras/gameLogo.png?t=1750199039\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806960/extras/rat_run.gif?t=1750199039\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806960/extras/experience_rat.png?t=1750199039\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience Rat Like Never Before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In<i> Really Fast Rat,</i> you take control of a little Rat who, after losing their cheese to a spatial anomaly, must run through a new world. A world with new people, new places, and new rules. But who cares about that when you're a Rat looking for cheese am I right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you be able to help our brave and noble Rat make their way out of this strange new world? Probably not, since that's not the goal of the game, the goal is to find the cheese, keep up please!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806960/extras/features.png?t=1750199039\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full Singleplayer campaign with several levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tailored moveset.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Levels with several paths to take.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A unique take on video game dashes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pace indicators and PB saving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ranks to beat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hub worlds to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlockable hats to customise the Rat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cute player sprites and animations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And More!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>","developers":["White Ruby"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806960/29bf9bada903aa002eda5e7cbfcb49ac333ea73b/header.jpg?t=1750199039","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257158050,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steams